# To Lead and Be Led (Q118), reads the other academy quest: an apprentice that took the other academy quest (started) is turned away with the page for it.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed.java, Quest.getSponsor and Quest.getApprentice)
# and the clan mate lines of the scenario format (#4175).
character Pupil 19
clan 3
mate Chief 19 leader sponsor
quest Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower <state>=STARTED <cond>=1 state=1
script quest.Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed
script quest.Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower
item 1458 7850 7851 7852 7853 7854 7855 7856 7857 7858 7859 8062 8063 8549 8550
page trainer/30298.htm
page script/quest/Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed/
page script/quest/Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower/
npc pinter 30298 Trainer 10 0 0

action pinter
action pinter
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=pinter item=0 page=trainer/30298.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{pinter}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=pinter item=0 page=script/quest/Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed/30298-02b.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
